---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Greeneville AI Meetup: What AI Can Do for You" description="A free evening to learn what AI can do for you, from first steps to deep technical dives, with hands-on help and plenty of time for questions. Thursday, November 12, 2026, 7–9pm, Greeneville/Greene County Public Library.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Greeneville AI Meetup: What AI Can Do for You</h1>
    <p><strong>What can AI do for you?</strong> If you've heard about ChatGPT and AI but feel like you don't know what's going on, this evening is for you. And if you're already using AI and want to go deeper, it's for you too.</p>
    <p>The Greeneville AI Meetup is a free, friendly evening for everyone, whatever your age or background. Beginners are especially welcome, and no technical experience is needed. We'll cover:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Chat:</strong> asking AI tools like ChatGPT and Claude for help with writing, research, planning and everyday questions</li>
      <li><strong>Agents:</strong> newer tools like Codex and Claude Code that don't just answer questions, but actually do work for you</li>
      <li><strong>Hands-on practice:</strong> bring a phone or laptop if you have one and try it yourself, with help (optional)</li>
      <li><strong>The deep end:</strong> a live look at how AI agents build real software, for anyone who wants the technical details</li>
      <li><strong>In-depth Q&amp;A:</strong> ask anything, at any level</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Presented by Jordan Last, an agentic engineer with an emphasis in software development.</p>
    <p><strong>Thursday, November 12, 2026, 7–9pm</strong><br>Big Spring Room, Greeneville/Greene County Public Library, 210 N Main St<br>Free and open to everyone. Hosted by Millillion.</p>
    <p><a class="cta" href="/greeneville-ai-meetup.ics">Add to calendar</a> <a class="cta" href="mailto:lastmjs@millillion.org?subject=Greeneville%20AI%20Meetup%20RSVP">RSVP by email</a> <a class="cta" href="/meetup/slides/">Slides</a> <a class="cta" href="#event-news">Sign up for event news</a></p>
    <p class="muted">The meetup is held at the library; it isn't a library-sponsored program.</p>
    <h2 id="event-news">Millillion event news</h2>
    <p>Sign up to hear about Millillion events: the next Greeneville AI Meetup, other meetups, conferences and anything else Millillion hosts.</p>
    <p id="joined" class="notice" hidden>Thank you. You're on the list.</p>
    <p id="join-error" class="notice" hidden>Sorry, that didn't go through. Please check your email address and try again.</p>
    <form class="contact-form" method="post" action="/api/events">
      <label>Name <input name="name" required maxlength="200" autocomplete="name" /></label>
      <label>Email <input name="email" type="email" required maxlength="200" autocomplete="email" /></label>
      <input type="hidden" name="source" value="meetup page" />
      <label class="hp" aria-hidden="true">Company <input name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
      <button class="cta primary" type="submit">Sign up</button>
    </form>
  </article>
  <script is:inline>
    const q = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
    if (q.has("joined")) document.getElementById("joined").hidden = false;
    if (q.has("error")) document.getElementById("join-error").hidden = false;
  </script>
</Base>
